## Worksheet

**F1**: G state object; makeRng(seed) drives all rng calls (production skill, terrain, events); resolveTurnCore→endTurnAuto fixed order (hazard→production→needs→fatigue→morale→event→finish). Score 2.

**F2**: genMap loops 8x8, pickWeighted(G.rng,...) picks terrain; canBuildAt checks def.terrain.includes(tile.terrain); neighborTerrainMatch adds adjacency.bonus into produced amt in resolveProduction. Score 2.

**F3**: mine→forge (ore→metal), composter→greenhouse (ash implicit→soil→food); addRes()/storageCap() enforce caps and log overflow as lost. Score 2.

**F4**: colonists have skill/fatigue/morale/job/assigned; skillFactor(worker.skill), fatigueFactor(worker.fatigue) read in resolveProduction's ratio calc. Score 2.

**F5**: resolveNeeds computes food/water shortage, writes c.morale delta; moraleFactor(worker.morale) used in production ratio; morale recovers +2/turn when needs met. Score 2.

**F6**: 9 RESEARCH nodes; canResearch enforces def.prereq.every(done); purchaseResearch deducts scrip/parts; condenserMult/generatorMult/stormMitigation/repairDiscount all read in resolveHazard/resolveProduction/repairCost. Score 2.

**F7**: 12 EVENTS; pickWeighted(G.rng, eligible, e=>e.weight); 5 events (wandererArrives, contaminatedWater, colonistDispute, ashLungSickness, raiderSkirmish) have divergent-effect choices; eventState[id] cooldown gate. Score 2.

**F8**: buyPrice reads storageCap ratio + market.drift (drifts via rng each turn); inventory qty capped, decremented on tradeBuy; tradeBuy/tradeSell both mutate G.res. Score 2.

**F9**: resolveHazard fires turn%8===0, severity = 8+floor(turn/8)*3; damageFactor(b.damage) cuts production ratio; windbreak/stormShelters/reinforced mitigate; repairBuilding spends parts, resets damage=0. Score 2.

**F10**: serializeState→JSON.stringify into textarea; loadBtn JSON.parse + validateSaveObj with per-field errors shown in loadMsg. Score 2.

**F11**: checkEndConditions handles win (turn≥60,pop≥12,no shortage) and lose (pop=0), both reachable via triggerable state; computeScore combines pop/research/stock/turn; showEndScreen renders summary. Score 2.

**F12**: switchTab wired to nav buttons + keydown 1-5; pushLog stores G.turn shown as "T{turn}"; attachTooltip/resTooltipHtml explain number sources; Space shortcut for end turn; @media(max-width:480px) adapts layout. Score 2.

**F13**: runTests asserts real invariants (storage caps, PRNG determinism, prereq enforcement, save/load hash equality, bounds after 20 turns); runBenchmark runs 200 headless turns via greedyPolicyTurn+endTurnAuto, prints stateHash. Score 2.

**G1**: RESEARCH.efficientCondensers.condenserMult/geothermal.generatorMult read via G.research.done check inside resolveProduction's yieldMult, changes producedLog amt shown in resBar tooltip. Score 4.

**G2**: resolveNeeds shortage→c.morale delta; moraleFactor(worker.morale) feeds ratio in resolveProduction every turn, visible via lastRatio/tooltip. Score 4.

**G3**: resolveHazard damages b.damage; damageFactor(b.damage) cuts ratio in resolveProduction; repairBuilding spends parts and resets damage=0 restoring output. Score 4.

**G4**: buyPrice = TRADE_BASE_PRICE * drift[res] * scarcity(G.res[res]/cap); drift updated each turn in updateMarketForNewTurn via rng. Score 4.

**G5**: wandererArrives/contaminatedWater/colonistDispute/ashLungSickness choices each mutate G.res or c.morale/c.assigned differently, not just logged. Score 4.

